{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c9a4d7e2-8b3f-4e1a-86d0-2f5c7b9e1d4a",
    "name": "AlgoChat API — Client",
    "description": "📡 **AlgoChat — Frontend API Collection (Client Side)**\n\nThis collection mirrors the **server collection** but documents every route from the *frontend's point of view*: which React store action / component calls it, what it sends, and what it does with the response.\n\n## 🔗 Frontend ↔ Backend Mapping\n| Frontend caller | Store action / file | HTTP request |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| SignupPage | `useAuthStore.signup` | `POST /auth/signup` |\n| AuthPage | `useAuthStore.login` | `POST /auth/login` |\n| AuthSync (on mount) | `useAuthStore.checkAuth` | `GET /auth/check` |\n| Sidebar / Navbar | `useAuthStore.logout` | `POST /auth/logout` |\n| ProfilePage (onboarding) | `useAuthStore.updateFullName` | `PUT /auth/fullname` |\n| ProfilePage (avatar) | `useAuthStore.updateProfile` | `PUT /auth/update-profile` |\n| Sidebar | `useChatStore.getUsers` | `GET /messages/users` |\n| ChatContainer | `useChatStore.getMessages` | `GET /messages/:id` |\n| MessageInput | `useChatStore.sendMessage` | `POST /messages/send/:id` |\n| MediaPage | direct axios call | `GET /messages/media` |\n| useAuthStore.connectSocket | Socket.io client | WS connection `?userId=<id>` |\n\n## ⚙️ How the client talks to the API\n- Base URL comes from `client/src/lib/axios.js`: `http://localhost:5001/api` in development, `/api` in production.\n- Every request passes through an axios interceptor that attaches `Authorization: Bearer <token>` from `localStorage.token` (see `client/src/lib/token.js`), plus `withCredentials: true`.\n\n## 🚀 Quick Start\n1. Start the server (`cd server && npm run dev`) and the client (`cd client && npm run dev`).\n2. Run **Auth → Signup** or **Login** here — the JWT is auto-saved to `{{token}}`, exactly like the app does with `localStorage`.\n3. Copy a partner `_id` from **Messages → Get users for sidebar** into the `{{userId}}` variable.\n4. Send messages and fetch the conversation.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "algochat-client"
  },
